موسوعة الكتاب المقدس
Bible Encyclopedia reader

This repository holds two different kinds of material. They are not licensed the same way.

1. The reader application
   The application source — everything in this repository except the encyclopedia
   texts and the generated reading data — is released under the MIT License below.
   That means the folders and files used to build the site: src (except
   src/data/catalog.ts, which is generated from the catalog), scripts, config,
   and the visual assets in public/art.

2. The encyclopedia material
   The articles, titles, and catalog are not part of the MIT grant.
   This includes:
   - attachments/*.txt
   - attachments/catalog.json
   - attachments/catalog-2.json
   - public/data/**
   - src/data/catalog.ts

   That material belongs to its owner. It was placed here for personal reading,
   as the owner allowed. It is not for commercial republication, resale, or
   relicensing. Do not copy it into another product, dataset, or book.

If you fork this repository, keep this distinction. You may reuse the reader.
You may not treat the encyclopedia texts as open content.

